      "id": 1,
      "text": "Winton’s name evolved from Winfield when the Santa Fe Railroad already had a station with that name in Arizona, so locals dropped “‑field” and added “‑ton.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
