      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winton%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Winton Historical Society was founded in 2004 to preserve the town’s unique rural heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://wintonhistoricalsociety.wordpress.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before Winton rose, a small settlement called Yam sprang up at the Santa Fe line, complete with a Yam Hotel and store.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winton%2C_California"
    },
    {
